{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13766","headline":"郑女弹筝歌 · 顾况","name":"郑女弹筝歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郑女八岁能弹筝，春风吹落天上声。\n一声雍门泪承睫，两声赤鲤露鬐鬣。\n二声白猿臂拓颊，郑女出参丈人时。\n落花惹断游空丝，高楼不掩许声出，羞杀百舌黄莺儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13766.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13766","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}